<view class="page"><view class="row"><view class="eyebrow">PIXEL ROOM</view><view class="link" bindtap="settings">设置 ↗</view></view><view class="heading">快乐，读档中.</view><view class="subtitle">熟悉的像素，新的冒险。<br/>从一张卡带开始。</view><view wx:if="loading" class="note">正在读取卡带…</view><view wx:if="error" class="note error">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="load">重新读取</button></view><view wx:for="{{games}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="cover"><view class="cartridge"><text class="cartridge-sub">FAMILY COMPUTER</text><text class="cartridge-name">{{item.title}}</text><text class="cartridge-pixel">▦</text><text class="cartridge-sub">8-BIT ADVENTURE</text></view><view class="cover-label">THE NES COLLECTION</view></view><view class="card-body"><view class="card-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="meta">NES / FC · {{item.sizeLabel}} · 单人</view><button class="primary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openGame">打开卡带 ↗</button></view></view><view wx:if="!loading &amp;&amp; !games.length &amp;&amp; !error" class="note">游戏库暂时为空，请稍后再来。</view><view class="note">存档保存在当前设备的播放器中。</view><view class="footer">小小像素，大大快乐。</view></view>
